harness: jxl-encoder/examples/e7_cost_attribution.rs with E7_ARM="e7 default"
         and __JXL_ENC_PHASE_TIMING=1 (feature `__env_var_diagnostics`)
host: Darwin 25.5.0 aarch64 (mac)
date: 2026-09-10
arms: TWO BINARIES, alternated within the run — `before` is the parent revision
      c7decbb3, `after` is that plus the BFS already-background prefilter.
      5 alternations per image; the table reports min per arm. Cross-run
      before/after comparison was rejected: the same grid re-run drifted +7.2 %
      on total wall between builds.
cells: 5 images x 5 reps x 2 arms, 1024x1024 centre crops, d=1.0, effort 7.
columns: bfs_done_ms is cumulative from scan start, so BFS = bfs_done - steps12.

  image                       BFS before  BFS after   delta   scan before  after  delta   bytes
  7078 plots                    10.90       7.30      -33 %      13.80    10.30   -25 %   96873 both
  8210 web-screenshot            8.10       5.50      -32 %      11.50     9.00   -22 %   86679 both
  5058 nps brochure              9.90       7.20      -27 %      15.70    13.10   -17 %   61733 both
