  8000 mobile screenshot        10.60       6.90      -35 %      13.80    10.00   -28 %   85544 both

The 6th image in the loop (6000 patents) is absent: the path used was wrong and
the probe panicked on open. It is covered by the 1,330-cell byte-identity grid.

byte identity: all five images identical between arms on every repeat, and the
  1,330-cell corpus grid (patches_scan_yield_2026-09-10.pointer.md) matches on
  bytes AND all fifteen per-stage scan counters.
locks: 68/68 hash locks and 5/5 Libjxl byte locks byte-identical; full
  `cargo test -p jxl-encoder --release` green (1585 + 507 + ...).
regression gate: `patches_scan_stage_counters_are_frozen` in patches.rs pins all
  fifteen counters on a synthetic screenshot fixture. Its frozen values were
  captured with the prefilter REVERTED, so they predate the optimisation.
  Mutation-verified: widening the BFS colour threshold 10 % moves bg_count
  55191 -> 55206 and fails the test.
